  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Lany Space, born from two best friends facing urban challenges in New York and Los Angeles, offers chic, affordable rugs inspired by modern nomad living since July 2022. The brand embodies urban dynamism and sustainability into each rug: stylish design, non-slip utility, and easy upkeep.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Threads and patterns meld, crafting tales that resonate with liberated individuality, celebrating city life's essence and welcoming others to join their evolving story.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product Description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Affordable/Budget-friendly&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Easy Upkeep: Machine Washable and Easy Clean (wipe-clean for spills)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Stylish: Various Chic Designs</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Non-Slip and Comfortable</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Easy to Move with You: Not Heavy</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Pet-Friendly</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms: Monthly in USD<br>&bull; Other information: US-only affiliates</p>\r\n</div>",
